---
source: core/src/orchestrator/tests/mod.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Update a runtime setting (skill_<name> toggles, user_timezone, display_language, mcp_enabled, embedding_*). HITL approval required. Call only when the owner asks, or when timezone is clearly wrong (ask first). See the settings prompt module for key constraints."
name: update_setting
parameters:
  properties:
    key:
      description: "Setting key (e.g. skill_server_monitor, user_timezone, display_language)"
      type: string
    value:
      description: "New value: boolean for toggles, IANA string for user_timezone, number for numeric keys"
  required:
    - key
    - value
  type: object
